>I have an Identify (which I know would be handy), Magic Mapping, and Finger of
>Death, to name a few.  These all seem very useful, eh?   I read in the spoiler
>file that reading a blessed spellbook will "ALWAYS work".  Can someone please
>confirm this for me before I waste my precious Holy Water.
>
  Identify is indeed very useful - allows safe usage of newly found items.
Magic mapping speeds up Gehennom stage a lot.
  I found charm monster to be one of the most useful spell in the late stages
(endgame and dealing with wizard's "pets"). 
  But there are people who ascend with no (or almost no) spell use - so they 
are not essential.

>One last thing.  Provided I can learn these spells, what are my casting odds.
>
  your INT + your luck must be higher or equal to 3*spell level. No place for 
odds here. You also need a strength of minimum 6, can't be overloaded, must 
have enough power and can't be too hungry.

